# Project Structure Summary

## Organized Folders:

📁 src/          - Core pipeline source code
🐳 docker/      - Docker configuration files
📨 kafka/       - Kafka streaming code
🌐 web/         - Streamlit web application
🛠️ scripts/     - CLI tools and scripts
📚 examples/    - Example implementations
📖 docs/        - Documentation and research paper
🧪 tests/       - Test suite
📊 data/        - Data storage directories

## Quick Commands:

# Pipeline
python3 -m src.simple_end_to_end

# Big Data Generator
python3 scripts/generate_big_data_cli.py --cities 25

# Web App
streamlit run web/streamlit_app.py

# Docker
cd docker && docker-compose up -d

